{
 "id": 1786912,
 "titulo": "4/4 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1680591684942,
 "modificada": 1775155346438,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1786912",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1642484088451\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fb6d1abccb364a5981c9cb4a33768459_1642484088451_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The mad Titan who has aimed for true peace&nbsp;<br>\nand the Squirrel Girl who has defeated him in unknown ways</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">has prepared a lot to surprise our Agents!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Thanos </span>has found enlightenment and has become a harvester<br>\nwith the new Uniform and Tier-4.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Squirrel Girl</span> will show the new potential of a Titan&nbsp;<br>\nwith the new Uniform and Tier-3.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nAgents, check out their new skills and power<br>\nby downloading the 4/4 Patch!</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">■ 4/4 Patch Details</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 4/5 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 4/4 (Tue) 20:00 (PDT)&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[4/5 (Wed) 2:50 (UTC+0), 4/4 (Tue) 19:50 (PDT) added]</span><br>\nWe are sorry to inform our Agents who have been waiting for the patch that the patch is being delayed.<br>\nFurther notice will be made through this notice once the patch has been completed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[4/5 (Wed) 3:30 (UTC+0), 4/4 (Tue) 20:30 (PDT) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed as of 4/5 (Wed) 3:28 (UTC+0), 4/4 (Tue) 20:28 (PDT).&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances&nbsp;<br>\nand</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"> the completion time will be announced once the patch has been finished</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Two New Uniforms</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Two new Uniforms Thanos &lt;Wise Harvester&gt;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">and Squirrel Girl &lt;Nutty Titan&gt; have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 4/4 Patch data is applied.<br>\n* The new Uniforms can only be purchased during the event period.</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Thanos &lt;Wise Harvester&gt;:&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 4/4 Patch - 4/18 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0),&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">After the 4/4 Patch - 4/18 (Tue) 7:59 (PDT)&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Purchase method: Crystal purchase (Discount events will not be applied.)</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Squirrel Girl &lt;Nutty Titan&gt;:&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 4/4 Patch - 4/21 (Fri) 14:59 (UTC+0),&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">After the 4/4 Patch - 4/21 (Fri) 7:59 (PDT)&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Purchase method: Can be exchanged at the Event Shop with Delightful Tokens<br>\n- Delightful Tokens can be acquired by purchasing event products or more&nbsp;until&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4/18 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0), 4/18 (Tue) 7:59 (PDT).&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The April Fools’ Day Uniforms may be available for purchase again&nbsp;<br>\nafter the event has been over through similar events or packages.&nbsp;<br>\n* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats.<br>\n(Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6)&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1887\" id=\"1680584814192\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b5bb84e2a1ba48a1aa90800da081e7e3_1680584814192_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1635\" id=\"1680503407208\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/4236ce4440454f41a926f9a048723e9d_1680503407208_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Squirrel Girl Tier-3</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Squirrel Girl is now available for Tier-3 Advancement.<br>\nShe will drive out outlaws with the help of her clever squirrel friends.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"358\" id=\"1680503462885\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/1b442e85d6e84073b76d4de9f81c0f39_1680503462885_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1680503472235\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/8f378a9b1e7e45bb946d64a290259185_1680503472235.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Thanos Tier-4</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thanos is now available for Tier-4 Advancement.<br>\nWho dares to stand against the rage of the Titan?</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1680503808297\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f5a6c48c7f8249beb9d06713c0a69649_1680503808297_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Artifacts</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new Artifact has been added for Squirrel Girl.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"330\" id=\"1680503523903\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/dec08bcb9d73492f82cf8e439f07a552_1680503523903_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Game Error Fixes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The issue of the hero modeling of Green Goblin &lt;Ultimate&gt;&nbsp;<br>\nbeing displayed abnormally when advancing to Tier-3 has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1680503246777\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/5ae87a46b6c54394ba865d7403687bf3_1680503246777_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
}